{
    "title": "Yahoo News: Your Guide to News",
    "description": "Yahoo News gives you news that is on point! with free, unlimited access to the stories and topics that matter most to you. Aggregating news from premium publishers, you can keep up with your world through a feed personalized to your interests and preferences. Never miss out on breaking world, national or local news updates, plus read about entertainment, lifestyle and more.\r\n\r\nYahoo News has been bringing readers the latest headlines and hottest trends from trusted sources for over 20 years. Join the millions of people who get personalized news updates from Yahoo News, and access the following benefits.\r\n\r\nYahoo News Features: \r\n\r\nPERSONALIZATION: Keep up with the news you care about through a personalized feed that adapts to your interests, while helping you stay informed with the most important breaking headlines. Instantly access the stories, topics and publishers that matter most to you, and adjust your preferences at any time to improve your feed and notifications. Block any keywords or specific publishers you don\u2019t want to hear from, and make your news feed uniquely yours. \r\n\r\nCHOOSE FROM MANY PREMIUM NEWS SOURCES: Yahoo News aggregates content from the best global publishers \u2014 from CNN and Time to Business Insider, People and Esquire \u2014 so you can feel confident that you have access to the best, and most comprehensive news providers out there. Get perspectives from a broad range of publishers, and opt into updates from your favorites.\r\n\r\nBREAKING NEWS FROM AROUND THE WORLD: Get global breaking news headlines that matter to you, wherever you are. Yahoo News partners with international news organizations like Associated Press, Reuters and The Washington Post, that report on the biggest world stories and current events. You\u2019ll never miss a beat.\r\n\r\nLOCAL NEWS: We know how important it is to keep up with local news, which is why we\u2019ve partnered with an array of local publishers like the Miami Herald, Charlotte Observer, NY Post and more, so you can stay on top of local politics, news, events, weather updates, crime and other important conversations in your neighborhood.\r\n\r\nNO PAYWALLS: Yahoo News is completely free to use. Access unlimited stories from premium publishers, so you can always stay on top of the topics you care about.\r\n\r\nDIVERSE RANGE OF TOPICS: Yahoo News is proud to aggregate content from a vast range of publishers. In addition to our proprietary Yahoo coverage of News, Entertainment, and Lifestyle content, you will also get access to the other topics you love like: celebrity, sports, movies & television, music, technology, health & wellness, parenting, style & beauty, travel, home & garden, autos, shopping, horoscope, science, weather and more.\r\n\r\nQUICK AI TAKEAWAYS: AI-generated, scannable, bulleted takeaways for articles make it easy to get the most important elements of a story in an instant. Harnessing the power of AI, users can quickly browse the key points of stories and stay in the know.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Yahoo News gives you news that is on point! with free, unlimited access to the stories and topics that matter most to you. Aggregating news from premium publishers, you can keep up with your world through a feed personalized to your interests and preferences. Never miss out on breaking world, national or local news updates, plus read about entertainment, lifestyle and more.<br><br>Yahoo News has been bringing readers the latest headlines and hottest trends from trusted sources for over 20 years. Join the millions of people who get personalized news updates from Yahoo News, and access the following benefits.<br><br>Yahoo News Features: <br><br>PERSONALIZATION: Keep up with the news you care about through a personalized feed that adapts to your interests, while helping you stay informed with the most important breaking headlines. Instantly access the stories, topics and publishers that matter most to you, and adjust your preferences at any time to improve your feed and notifications. Block any keywords or specific publishers you don\u2019t want to hear from, and make your news feed uniquely yours. <br><br>CHOOSE FROM MANY PREMIUM NEWS SOURCES: Yahoo News aggregates content from the best global publishers \u2014 from CNN and Time to Business Insider, People and Esquire \u2014 so you can feel confident that you have access to the best, and most comprehensive news providers out there. Get perspectives from a broad range of publishers, and opt into updates from your favorites.<br><br>BREAKING NEWS FROM AROUND THE WORLD: Get global breaking news headlines that matter to you, wherever you are. Yahoo News partners with international news organizations like Associated Press, Reuters and The Washington Post, that report on the biggest world stories and current events. You\u2019ll never miss a beat.<br><br>LOCAL NEWS: We know how important it is to keep up with local news, which is why we\u2019ve partnered with an array of local publishers like the Miami Herald, Charlotte Observer, NY Post and more, so you can stay on top of local politics, news, events, weather updates, crime and other important conversations in your neighborhood.<br><br>NO PAYWALLS: Yahoo News is completely free to use. Access unlimited stories from premium publishers, so you can always stay on top of the topics you care about.<br><br>DIVERSE RANGE OF TOPICS: Yahoo News is proud to aggregate content from a vast range of publishers. In addition to our proprietary Yahoo coverage of News, Entertainment, and Lifestyle content, you will also get access to the other topics you love like: celebrity, sports, movies &amp; television, music, technology, health &amp; wellness, parenting, style &amp; beauty, travel, home &amp; garden, autos, shopping, horoscope, science, weather and more.<br><br>QUICK AI TAKEAWAYS: AI-generated, scannable, bulleted takeaways for articles make it easy to get the most important elements of a story in an instant. Harnessing the power of AI, users can quickly browse the key points of stories and stay in the know.",
